# Rust build artifacts for the keyring cdylib; the crate source under ffi/ is
# tracked, its compiled output is not.
/ffi/target/

# The `compile` task's single-binary output.
/denomine-mcp

# Third-party notices that `deno task license` generates per target and the
# `compile` task embeds; see ADR-0013 for why they are not committed.
/third-party-licenses.json

# The commit the `compile` task writes for the binary to embed and removes once
# it is built, kept out in case a build is interrupted before the removal.
/build-info.json
